  unitName: Ogre
  unitId: 10172
  unitNumber: 270
  description: An upright-walking monster with a pig's head that inhabits areas where
    the fire element is strong. Those with abilities that surpass other Orcs evolve
    into Ogres which then take charge of the rest. Ogres carry special-made metal
    clubs, said to have been handed down from leader to leader. It is said that this
    was created by a human blacksmith long ago, though because Ogres value it more
    than life itself, it is exceedingly hard to study.
  summonDesc: You, a Summoner?<br>Sure, I help.<br>From today, we friends!
  fusionDesc: Give me power.<br>I help you.<br>You, friend.
  evoDesc: I know human words.<br>Only few.
  element: 1
  rarity: 2
